  &lt;/CodeBlock&gt;\n\n## Publish a track\n\nTo get started with Lattice, =
consider this scenario: a friendly drone with access to Lattice has picked =
up a new track\nthat appears to be a surface vessel. To configure this dron=
e to publish a track to Lattice as a new entity,\ndo the following:\n\n&lt;=
Steps&gt;\n  &lt;Step title=3D\&quot;Set your environment token\&quot;&gt;\=
n    Use the &lt;span class=3D\&quot;ui-element\&quot;&gt;**Lattice Auth To=
ken**&lt;/span&gt; from your environment details page as your environment t=
oken, then export it so the following commands can authenticate with Lattic=
e:\n\n    &lt;CodeBlock&gt;\n      ```bash title=3D\&quot;Bash\&quot;\n    =
  export ENVIRONMENT_TOKEN=3D&lt;YOUR_LATTICE_AUTH_TOKEN&gt;\n      ```\n  =
  &lt;/CodeBlock&gt;\n  &lt;/Step&gt;\n\n  &lt;Step title=3D\&quot;Define t=
he entity\&quot;&gt;\n    Copy the following entity JSON object and save it=
