&lt;YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssTZD&gt;\&quot;\n        }\n    }\n    ```\n  &lt;/St=
ep&gt;\n\n  &lt;Step title=3D\&quot;Publish the entity to Lattice\&quot;&gt=
