le=3D\&quot;curl\&quot;\n      curl --location \\\n      --request PUT \&qu=
ot;https://$LATTICE_ENDPOINT/api/v1/entities\&quot; \\\n      --header \&qu=
ot;content-type: application/json\&quot; \\\n      --header \&quot;authoriz=
ation: Bearer $ENVIRONMENT_TOKEN\&quot; \\\n      --header \&quot;anduril-s=
andbox-authorization: Bearer $SANDBOXES_TOKEN\&quot; \\\n      --include \\=
\n      --data \&quot;@entity.json\&quot;\n      ```\n    &lt;/CodeBlock&gt=
;\n  &lt;/Step&gt;\n\n  &lt;Step title=3D\&quot;Verify the response\&quot;&=
gt;\n    If the request is successful, you get a &lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=
=3D\&quot;success-color\&quot;&gt;**200**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt; status =
